        { type = "note", name = "This next segment takes place in Searing Gorge. It's going to be EXTREMELY hard to quest there if you happen to start it during the Blackrock Eruption event. It occurs at midnight and then every two hours and lasts for an hour", note = "This means that you should only aim to start questing in Searing Gorge every odd hour and in the best case scenario you will only have 1 hour to quest untill the event starts. Consider either waiting for the event to end to begin questing or skipping this zone entirely - Click here to hide this message" },
